                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish, Secretary of
                        State, to Mr. Barlow, United States marshal,
                        New York.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1869-05-07"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 7,
                        1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis C. Barlow</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">United States Marshal, New York:</hi></p>
                <p>The Spanish minister says he has information that the Quaker City is being fitted
                    out and armed to cruise against Spanish commerce. Inquire into the matter with a
                    view to further proceedings.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>HAMILTON FISH.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
